{
  "about": "Secret material that some kinds carry inline, outside a core Secret (ADR-0120, ADR-0121, ADR-0123). `kinds` is the one table: crates/sextant-core/src/resources/inline_secrets.rs (INLINE_SECRETS, cargo test -p sextant-core inline_secrets) and src/resources/inlineSecrets.ts (vitest src/resources/inlineSecrets.test.ts) must both equal it. A path is a list of field names from the object's root; `*` stands for every item of a list. `paths` are recorded-change paths (the timeline's `spec.triggers[0].github.secret`, `metadata.annotations[\"k3s.io/node-args\"]`) and whether each is, holds or lies under one of the kind's secret paths.",
